!     Total Area (m2) 107 m2  (1152 ft2)
!     Operable area (m2)
!System Type: DX air chillers with banks of compressors provide refrigeration
!Heating Type:  Unit heaters are used to maintain temperatures during the winter
!               for the Coolers and Dock area.
!Fuel: Electricity
!Water Consumption is not modeled.
!References
!   [1] - PG&E, Codes and Standards Enhancement Initiative (Case) - 2008 California Energy Commission Title 24 Building Energy Efficience Standards, February 27
!   [2] - Refrigerated Warehouse - Code Requirements in California Title 24; Drafted by Tianzhen Hong, April 2009
!   [3] - B. Prakash and R. Paul Singh; Energy Benchmarking of Warehouses for Frozen Food; Department of Biological and Agricultural Engineering, University of California, Davis, CA 95616; September 14, 2007
!   [4] - BAC Product & Application Handbook, volume II - 2007
!   [5] - On-line data for Bitzer refrigeration compressors
! DualThermostats used for:
!   Freezer spaces at -18C.
!   Blast freezer spaces at -25C.
!   Cooler spaces at 4C
! Single Thermostats with seasonal schedules used for:
!   Dock spaces at 10C
!   Office spaces at 20C
! Purchased air used for office auxiliary areas.
!
!
!-   ===========  ALL OBJECTS IN CLASS: VERSION ===========

Version,27.1;

!-   ===========  ALL OBJECTS IN CLASS: BUILDING ===========

Building,
  Refridgerated Warehouse,  !- Name
  90.0,                    !- North Axis {deg}
  City,                    !- Terrain
  0.04,                    !- Loads Convergence Tolerance Value {W}
  0.4,                     !- Temperature Convergence Tolerance Value {deltaC}
  FullInteriorAndExterior,  !- Solar Distribution
  25,                      !- Maximum Number of Warmup Days
  ;                        !- Minimum Number of Warmup Days

!-   ===========  ALL OBJECTS IN CLASS: TIMESTEP ===========

Timestep,4;

!-   ===========  ALL OBJECTS IN CLASS: SIMULATIONCONTROL ===========

SimulationControl,
  No,                      !- Do Zone Sizing Calculation
  No,                      !- Do System Sizing Calculation
  No,                      !- Do Plant Sizing Calculation
  Yes,                     !- Run Simulation for Sizing Periods
  Yes,                     !- Run Simulation for Weather File Run Periods
  No,                      !- Do HVAC Sizing Simulation for Sizing Periods
  1;                       !- Maximum Number of HVAC Sizing Simulation Passes

