! Freezer_1AirChiller_1 is an example of a table look-up correction curve
!  Use Colmac Al5382.-3983-075L
!  Rated 87,100 W with 85% RH, inlet air of -23, DT1 of 5.5C
!        5 fans at 0.56 kW each = 2800 W, air flow of 20.67 m3/s
!        No info re electric defrost rating, but strong recommendation for hot gas defrost.
!

Refrigeration:AirChiller,
  Freezer_1AirChiller_1,   !- Name
  AvailAllYear,            !- Availability Schedule Name
  CapacityTotalSpecificConditions,  !- Capacity Rating Type
  ,                        !- Rated Unit Load Factor {W/K}
