  ColmacCoilInc,           !- Capacity Correction Curve Name
  ,                        !- SHR60 Correction Factor {dimensionless}
  200.0,                   !- Rated Total Heating Power {W}
  AirChillerDripDownSched1,  !- Heating Power Schedule Name
  ,                        !- Fan Speed Control Type
