! Freezer-1AirChiller_2 is an example of a European rating
! FrigiBohn 2010 catalog: NKH4x8DC1
!   Don't have data for ammonia fixture, use R404 fixture and use 0.9 refrigerant correction factor
!   Rating data include: Standard Capacity (SC3) of 83,570 W at DT1 of 7K
!                        Fan air flow of 82,600 m3/h (22.9 m3/s), Fan power of 4*1250 = 5000
!                        Electric defrost at 34,200 W.

Refrigeration:AirChiller,
  Freezer_1AirChiller_2,   !- Name
  AvailAllYear,            !- Availability Schedule Name
  EuropeanSC3Standard,     !- Capacity Rating Type
  ,                        !- Rated Unit Load Factor {W/K}
  83570.0,                 !- Rated Capacity {W}
  ,                        !- Rated Relative Humidity {percent}
  -25.0,                   !- Rated Cooling Source Temperature {C}
  7.0,                     !- Rated Temperature Difference DT1 {deltaC}
  11.0,                    !- Maximum Temperature Difference Between Inlet Air and Evaporating Temperature {deltaC}
  ,                        !- Coil Material Correction Factor {dimensionless}
  0.9,                     !- Refrigerant Correction Factor {dimensionless}
  European,                !- Capacity Correction Curve Type
  ,                        !- Capacity Correction Curve Name
  ,                        !- SHR60 Correction Factor {dimensionless}
  200.0,                   !- Rated Total Heating Power {W}
  AirChillerDripDownSched2,  !- Heating Power Schedule Name
  ,                        !- Fan Speed Control Type
  5000.0,                  !- Rated Fan Power {W}
  22.9,                    !- Rated Air Flow {m3/s}
  ,                        !- Minimum Fan Air Flow Ratio {dimensionless}
  Electric,                !- Defrost Type
  TimeSchedule,            !- Defrost Control Type
  AirChillerDefrostSched2,  !- Defrost Schedule Name
  AirChillerDripDownSched2,  !- Defrost Drip-Down Schedule Name
  34200.0,                 !- Defrost Power {W}
  ,                        !- Temperature Termination Defrost Fraction to Ice {dimensionless}
  ,                        !- Vertical Location
  ;                        !- Average Refrigerant Charge Inventory {kg}

! Remaining chillers for Freezer_1 zone.
! -18C is desired zone temperature
! max sensible load was 1,082,000W with ideal air (no latent included)
! avg cap was 386,000W with ideal air (no latent included)
! Try with 1,200,000W total and DT1 of 8C, so unit load factor is 150,000 W/DeltaC
! See BAC AS5S-4084-050L, fan 0.5 HP (0.5 hp = 373 W), airflow 26,250 cfm(1 ft3 = 0.02833 m3, so ~12.4 m3/s),
!                     frosted capacity 20,650 B/h-F (~10,900 W/C), so need 13 of them (got by with 12)
!  Will do Evap T of -26C, let heater = 200W,
!  Use electric defrost - capacity large to limit time and handle latent load
!  Electric defrost capacity, BAC recommends 11 W/ft2 (this model has 5,006 ft2), so 55066W
!  AirChiller_5 uses a hot fluid defrost with temperature termination

Refrigeration:AirChiller,
  Freezer_1AirChiller_3,   !- Name
  AvailAllYear,            !- Availability Schedule Name
  UnitLoadFactorSensibleOnly,  !- Capacity Rating Type
  10900.0,                 !- Rated Unit Load Factor {W/K}
  ,                        !- Rated Capacity {W}
  ,                        !- Rated Relative Humidity {percent}
  -26.0,                   !- Rated Cooling Source Temperature {C}
  8.0,                     !- Rated Temperature Difference DT1 {deltaC}
  11.0,                    !- Maximum Temperature Difference Between Inlet Air and Evaporating Temperature {deltaC}
  ,                        !- Coil Material Correction Factor {dimensionless}
  ,                        !- Refrigerant Correction Factor {dimensionless}
  LinearSHR60,             !- Capacity Correction Curve Type
  ,                        !- Capacity Correction Curve Name
